				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Required overrides\n\nThree methods are declared on the trait via `^ self explicitRequirement` and inherited from the composing coder hierarchy: {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>application}}, {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>currentSourceString}}, {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>notifyObjectSpawn:requesterObject:}}.\n\n`contextModuleName` is the override hook — the trait returns nil; users override to provide module context. {{gtMethod:name=ElixirFunctionCoder>>contextModuleName}} returns `moduleCoder moduleName`; {{gtMethod:name=GtElixirCoderModel>>contextModuleName}} reads an ivar set by callers like {{gtMethod:name=ElixirModuleCoder>>buildSourceViewElement}}."
			},
			{
