					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Shortcut registration\n\nEach user calls `self initializeNavigationShortcuts: addOns` from its own `initializeShortcuts:`. Don't reuse Ctrl-G — it's {{gtClass:name=GtSourceCoderDoItAndInspectShortcut}}."
			},
