				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## ^ self in shortcut actions — DON'T\n\nThe `action:` block in {{gtClass:name=BlShortcutWithAction}} fires after the defining method has already returned. `^ self` raises `BlockCannotReturn`. Use `ifNotNil:` / `ifTrue:` guards. Same rule applies to any block that outlives its definer — announcement subscriptions, scheduled tasks, etc."
			},
